| Cell Design Specification | design_spec.md / .pdf | ✅ Complete |
| Bill of Materials | bom.xlsx / .pdf | ✅ Complete |
| Technical Datasheet | datasheet.md / .pdf | ✅ Complete |
| Design Calculation Sheet | calc.xlsx / .pdf | ✅ Complete |
| Design Verification Report | dvpr.md / .pdf | ✅ Complete |
| Design FMEA | dfmea.md / .pdf | ✅ Complete |
| Delivery Index | delivery_index.md / .pdf | ✅ Complete |
| HTML Report | report.html | ✅ Complete |

---

## Audit Trail

- **Entry 0**: Criteria definition
- **Entry 1**: Design plan
- **Entries 2-13**: Propose/evaluate cycles (4 rounds)
- **Entry 14**: Final conclusion with three-strike escalation

All entries are traceable in `log.jsonl` with mechanical verdict generation via `bda log-evaluate`.

---

**Note**: This is a virtual design based on simulation results. Physical validation required before production release.
